## Board
<div aria-describedby="upper-hint" aria-labelledby="upper-label" class="lib-text lib-tone yh-settings-row" data-part="root" data-role="body" data-tabular="" role="group" style="--yh-settings-label-w: 120px">
  <span class="yh-settings-row__label" data-part="label" id="upper-label" title="Upper">
    "Upper"
  <span class="yh-settings-row__control" data-part="control">
    {children}
  <span class="yh-settings-row__hint" data-part="hint" id="upper-hint" title="Chords from the right hand">
    "Chords from the right hand"

